    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to directing the department\nof health to establish and maintain a menopause informational and resource\nwebpage on the department website",
    "basePrintNo": "S8543",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8543-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
